# Personal notes / agent context - never commit
DEVLOG.md
NOTES.md
PERSONAL.md
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
chrisprofile.md
.cursor/
.aider*
.sprite

# Synced npm publish artifacts (regenerated from bin/ via scripts/sync-publish.js)
publish/bin/
publish/LICENSE
publish/NOTICE
publish/README.md
publish/*.tgz
